{"title":"2018 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2 Part A","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1\"><a href=\"#Problem_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Verifying_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Verifying Solution</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem_2\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\" title=\"2018 CSMC Problems/Part B Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2&amp;action=edit&amp;section=T-1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Determine the positive integer for which <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/5/4/454a17d215f123afeaee33e0dd823e2751428692.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{1}{x} = \\frac{1}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Multiplying both sides of the equation by <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/f/3/4f38e3869c6ef54bbbfb86ab5c8d336a257d398b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$4 \\times 6 \\times x = 24x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"128\" height=\"15\" />, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/9/7/e97b1e4302af59988c6f3dbf672e270f6fabd7eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$24x(\\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{1}{x}) = 24x \\times \\frac{1}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"182\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/3/2a334775ef0fe38e4f7d7b05ed508d1cb8d76d98.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6x - 24 = 4x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/9/a/49a4185db3a3a7f4877af31f9267dde6e910c84e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6x - 4x = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"105\" height=\"15\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/1/f/e1f1deffd7bf1b4b46ab26c62d28638467f91954.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2x = 24$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"64\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/6/b66dd6953e911b469f82287672a2097185ba62a3.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\frac{24}{2} = \\boxed{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"112\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Re-arranging the equation, we have:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/8/4/484ac6e75b596dfc7fc181ecfcad46caa911368c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{1}{6} = \\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"89\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/0/b/90b7033fa1eb69c2753341a5f9a4701ccba7ac3b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1 \\times 3}{4 \\times 3} - \\frac{1 \\times 2}{6 \\times 2} = \\frac{1}{x}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"151\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/1/e/d1e5f438639a175bb1f005d075fbc0a040c87fdb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x} = \\frac{3}{12} - \\frac{2}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"107\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/9/399ebed84314c4bf7e83e47fefd6958e3438b461.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{x} = \\frac{1}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"63\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p>The numerators are equal, meaning that the denominators must be equal. Thus, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/6/15649548afa16a5fbc10dd438ad34d3e30cd58b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = \\boxed{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -6px\" width=\"66\" height=\"25\" />.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Verifying_Solution\">Verifying Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2018_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2_Part_A&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Verifying Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>If <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/9/7/c975e64a5ed6e7d28e6f651e8102d070a417d4c2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = 12$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"52\" height=\"12\" />, then:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/c/5/0c5c527df2f7b54fba1c3d0652be24b4ad5863bc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{1}{x} = \\frac{1}{4} - \\frac{1}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"133\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/e/7/6e7a9fdd8466515ab3972913d86be51cb236aaf4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{1 \\times 3}{4 \\times 3} - \\frac{1 \\times 1}{12 \\times 1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"141\" height=\"40\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/7/1/4719b4ada335813ad5e6fa09bfda749fa926f74b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{3}{12} - \\frac{1}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"88\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/e/7/3e7abe1eca0a0344c8c6db81660dd651ac204306.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{2}{12}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"43\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/c/c/bcc4ac57a2d44764225fd56f9b259a47e60b1bb8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$=\\frac{1}{6}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"30\" height=\"37\" />\n</p><p>This matches what the original equation was equal to, so we have verified our answer.\n</p><p>~anabel.disher\n</p>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018062047\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.016 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.033 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 94/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 78/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 0/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 3630/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    6.599      1 2018_CSMC_Problems/Part_B_Problem_2\n100.00%    6.599      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:37290:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018062047 and revision id 287937. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}